sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Feature: Danger Word Alerts
    
    actor Blind User
    participant Cam as Camera
    participant OCR as OCR Engine
    participant Logic as Keyword Matcher
    participant Audio as Audio Service

    Cam->>OCR: Stream Frame
    OCR->>Logic: Raw Text: "Welcome to... CAUTION WET FLOOR... the store"
    
    activate Logic
    Logic->>Logic: Check vs Danger List ["Danger", "Caution", "Stop"]
    
    opt Keyword Found
        Logic-->>Audio: Trigger Warning: "WET FLOOR"
        Audio->>Blind User: "Alert! Wet Floor Detected!"
    end
    deactivate Logic
